  "text": "### Right to Not Be Subject to Automated Decisions  \n**Protection:** High-impact automated decisions require human review  \n**Examples:**\n- Automated lending decision (mortgage application rejection)\n- Automated fraud detection (account freeze)\n- Automated credit scoring  \n**Right:**\n- Be informed of automated decision\n- Request human review\n- Provide own perspective\n- Appeal decision  \n---",
